cert. hell. — पन्थानं दा give the way to, go out of the way of
(gen.). पथि in the way, on the journey;
 पथानेन in this way or
manner.

पथि॑ (nom. प॑न्थास्) path, road, course, way, manner;
a cert. hell. — पन्थानं दा give the way to, go out of the way of
(gen.). पथि in the way, on the journey;
 पथानेन in this way or
