पथ्य a. customary, normal, regular, suitable, fit,
proper. n. fortune, good lock;
 hail to (gen. or dat.)! —f. पथ्या॑
path, way;
 w. रेव॑ती & स्वस्ति॑ the rich path (personif. as the
goddess of fortune).
